## Edge case
Temperature reading of 65F is used as an edge case. The code checks whether the temperature is below 65°F or above 75°F. At exactly 65°F, neither condition is true.
This is checked by the edge case to ensure the code works as intended.

Output: 
Returned alerts: []
At exactly 65°F, no comfort alert is created.

